                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo akawaambia Simeoni na Lawi, Mmenitaabisha, kunifanya ninuke vibaya kati ya watu wa nchi hii, Wakanaani na Waperizi; na mimi, kwa kuwa watu wangu ni haba, watanikusanyikia, na kunipiga, nami nitaangamizwa, mimi na nyumba yangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
